{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671128581380163882","title":"结构工程师","description":"1、协助进行显示模组产品零件，组装设计，分析模组生产、整机装配过程中的结构和工艺问题点；\r\n2、产品零部件3D及2D图的详细设计及相关的可行性分析和可生产性评估；\r\n3、项目开发进度跟踪和产品试产各个阶段现场跟进；\r\n4、协助处理质量问题，跟进可靠性验证、及量产产品零部件的认证验收与售后问题处理；\r\n5、新技术评估和跟踪。","requirement":"1、机械设计、材料科学及制造相关专业；\r\n2、至少会一种CAD设计软件（Pro／E，Caita等等）；\r\n3、熟悉注塑、五金零件加工工艺、模具结构、后处理工艺、钣金工艺结构；\r\n4、有较强的责任心,良好团队协作能力、沟通能力、谦虚踏实。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786073882531,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7671128581379983658","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"c